CUT=' One isolated front-facing painted-card cutout on a genuinely transparent alpha background, with every gap transparent. No backdrop, sky, shadows, floor beyond the object, rods, strings, frame or lettering. Entire object inside the image with a generous clear margin. Raw brown card cut edge.'
